# Decision One-Pager — AI-Powered Analytics Platform

## Context

Mid-Market SaaS Companies face the critical challenge of struggle with fragmented data insights and manual reporting processes. Market analysis shows significant opportunity with 84% confidence in our assessment. Key assumptions include A1, A2, A3 with 92% coverage.

## Options Considered

| Option | Pros | Cons | Investment | Timeline |
|--------|------|------|------------|----------|
| **Status Quo** | No investment required | Problem persists, competitive disadvantage | $0 | N/A |
| **AI-Powered Analytics Platform (Recommended)** | Significant business value, first-mover advantage | Development investment, market risk | High | 6 months |
| **Partner Solution** | Faster time-to-market | Limited control, revenue sharing | Medium | 3 months |

## ROI Range

| Scenario | Investment | Revenue | ROI | Confidence |
|----------|------------|---------|-----|------------|
| Bear | $500K | $1.2M | 140% | Low |
| **Base** | **$750K** | **$2.1M** | **180%** | Medium |
| Bull | $1M | $3.5M | 250% | High |

**Key Sensitivities:**
- Average Deal Size ±20% → Annual Revenue ±18%
- Market Growth Rate ±20% → Customer Count ±22%
- Customer Churn Rate ±20% → ROI ±12%

## Risks & Blast Radius

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Owner | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|--------|-------|------------|
| Market adoption slower than expected | Medium | High | Product | Phased rollout, early feedback |
| Competitive response | High | Medium | Strategy | IP protection, speed advantage |
| Technical complexity | Low | High | Engineering | Proven architecture, testing |

**Blast Radius:** Limited to Mid-Market SaaS Companies segment, rollback possible within 30 days

## Recommendation

**Decision:** GO  
**Confidence:** 84%

**Rationale:** High-quality evidence with strong source agreement and excellent coverage. Minor concerns around sensitivity to market changes. Market timing and competitive positioning create unique opportunity.

**Disconfirming Signals:**
- Customer adoption <50% of projections in first 60 days
- Competitive response within 90 days
- Technical issues affecting >10% of users

**Signal Owners:**
- Adoption metrics: Product Manager
- Competitive intelligence: Strategy Team
- Technical health: Engineering Manager

## Evidence Mechanisms

### Assumption Ledger

| ID | Name | Value | Certainty | Sources |
|----|------|-------|-----------|---------|
| A1 | Total Addressable Market | $1.8B | High | 1 |
| A2 | Average Deal Size | 25000 | Medium | 1 |
